# PayChain Trustee Fund Platform

The Trustee Fund Platform is the regulated banking and reserve-management layer supporting:

```text
paychain.cambobia.com
```

The platform will be operated by, hosted for, or jointly controlled with a licensed trustee bank.

Its purpose is to:

* Safeguard fiat funds supporting PayChain liabilities
* Receive reserve deposits
* Verify incoming bank funds
* Maintain designated trustee and reserve accounts
* Confirm reserve availability before PayChain issuance
* Control mint authorization
* Control redemption funding
* Produce proof-of-reserve evidence
* Reconcile bank balances against PayChain liabilities
* Support regulatory reporting
* Support independent audit and attestation
* Enforce AML, sanctions, KYC and transaction-monitoring requirements
* Prevent PayChain from creating value without verified backing
* Provide APIs and signed events to PayChain
* Provide emergency controls to the trustee bank
* Maintain legal and operational separation between bank-held fiat and PayChain-issued digital assets

The platform is not a public banking application.

It is a restricted institutional platform for:

