* Issued digital asset supply
* Burned digital asset supply
* Wallet balances
* Blockchain transactions
* Pending mint requests
* Pending redemption requests
* Digital-asset transaction history

The Trustee Fund Platform is authoritative for:

* Fiat reserves
* Reserve-account movements
* Deposit confirmation
* Redemption funding
* Settlement confirmation
* Reserve attestations
* Reserve exceptions
* Trustee approvals

