# 16. Reserve Calculation

Calculate:

```text
Eligible Reserve =
Cleared Bank Balance
- Restricted Funds
- Unmatched Funds
- Pending Outgoing Payouts
- Bank Charges Due
- Regulatory Holds
- Operational Funds
- Other Ineligible Amounts
```

Calculate:

```text
Reserve Obligation =
Circulating Supply
+ Confirmed Redemption Obligations
+ Other Contractual Liabilities
- Legally Approved Exclusions
```

Calculate:

```text
Reserve Ratio =
Eligible Reserve / Reserve Obligation
```

Support policies:

* 100% reserve
* Greater-than-100% overcollateralization
* Asset-specific buffer
* Intraday buffer
* Redemption-liquidity buffer
* Regulatory buffer

The default fiat-backed stablecoin configuration must require at least 100% eligible reserve unless the trustee bank approves another legally permitted model.

